=\"#/wiki/Terra%20Legs\">Terra Legs</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></li><li>Wereboar Loincloth</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["koshei-the-deathless-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"koshei-the-deathless-quest","quest":"Koshei the Deathless Quest","kind":"reward"}],"sell":[{"npc":"Gnomission","where":"Gnomegate","price":15000,"pos":{"x":33007,"y":31892,"z":9},"href":"#/wiki/Gnomission"}]}}